Notebook[{

Cell[CellGroupData[{
Cell["CausalInvarianceStyleMutation", "ObjectName",
 CellID->36896359,ExpressionUUID->"05d46b65-0a86-0b44-b839-a9e31a83e52c"],

Cell[TextData[{
 Cell["   ", "ModInfo",ExpressionUUID->"481e2019-7419-4c42-84fd-a9466629eb4a"],
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{
   ButtonBox["CausalInvarianceStyleMutation",
    BaseStyle->"Link",
    ButtonData->
     "paclet:SamuelFrerichs/StructureAdaptiveEvolution/ref/\
CausalInvarianceStyleMutation"], 
   RowBox[{"[", "rules", "]"}]}]], "InlineFormula",ExpressionUUID->
  "638b757e-4468-0b4f-82de-9b5ca1a4cb99"],
 " \[LineSeparator]",
 "proposes a causal-invariance-style mutation of a rule or rule set."
}], "Usage",
 CellID->346910291,ExpressionUUID->"8991d0b3-e119-5142-a919-d5f2afa1ba81"],

Cell["\<\
This is catalog strategy 15, \"CausalInvarianceStyle\", of the approved \
15-strategy mutation catalog.\
\>", "Notes",
 CellID->529024824,ExpressionUUID->"9cadae3a-4d5b-314f-b780-0dacbd31381f"],

Cell["\<\
Operators: SymmetrizeRHS and BoundaryPreserveRHS applied to one member rule \
(the result then carries \"RuleSetMember\" details), and AddInverseRule (add \
the inverse of a member, with variables renamed apart, as a new rule).\
\>", "Notes",
 CellID->321326274,ExpressionUUID->"98c8891c-5d41-c44b-8ee6-c55fb86c6191"],

Cell["\<\
Whether the resulting system is confluent is measured, not assumed: see the \
update-order metrics.\
\>", "Notes",
 CellID->853327683,ExpressionUUID->"ed6ee651-5f2c-e847-a00c-5ce5e108c923"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "The strategy is opt-in: select it with \"MutationStrategies\" -> \
{\"CausalInvarianceStyle\"} in ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  TemplateBox[{
   "StructureAdaptiveEvolution", 
    "paclet:SamuelFrerichs/StructureAdaptiveEvolution/ref/\
StructureAdaptiveEvolution", 
    "https://reference.wolfram.com/language/SamuelFrerichs/\
StructureAdaptiveEvolution/ref/StructureAdaptiveEvolution.html"},
   "TextRefLink",
   DisplayFunction->(TagBox[
     ButtonBox[
      StyleBox[#, ShowStringCharacters -> True, FontFamily -> 
       "Source Sans Pro"], 
      BaseStyle -> {"Link", FontColor -> LightDarkSwitched[
          RGBColor[0.02, 0.286, 0.651], 
          RGBColor[0.2823, 0.6666, 0.949]]}, ButtonData -> #2, ContentPadding -> 
      False], 
     MouseAppearanceTag["LinkHand"]]& )]],ExpressionUUID->
  "ace4bc47-8b22-8042-b3e8-a4c550fe9d0f"],
 ", or with \"Goal\" -> \"CausalInvarianceStyle\", whose preset also promotes \
the catalog's primary objectives for the strategy to Pareto objectives."
}], "Notes",
 CellID->382190165,ExpressionUUID->"9d1da527-49b1-6a45-a36a-f47be2e7bfee"],

Cell["\<\
Mutations are random. The result is a canonically new rule (or rule set), an \
Association with \"Rule\" and \"Details\", or a Failure when no valid new \
proposal exists. Inside a search, every operator that ran is recorded in the \
candidate's provenance.\
\>", "Notes",
 CellID->13546482,ExpressionUUID->"88fee662-54a2-4d42-b2b1-5bc1ae157b16"]
}, Open  ]],

